`:189`, where `Received: ""` — the
signature of a killed subprocess, not of a wrong expectation — and neither expectation line is
touched by P1 (P1's only sealed-variants change is L245). *Verified in source*: those are the
only assertion-error sites in both logs.

**Three supporting imprecisions, none of which changes the attribution:**

